WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:08.000
Agent safety depends on the entire execution trajectory.

00:00:08.000 --> 00:00:21.000
2,653 executable risk instances. Ten risk categories. Ten attack strategies.

00:00:21.000 --> 00:00:34.000
Discover risks, construct executable tests, and verify observable outcomes.

00:00:34.000 --> 00:00:47.000
Open-world threats become execution traces, supervision, and stronger guards.

00:00:47.000 --> 00:01:04.000
GuardPO aligns training with the safety decision across agent frameworks.

00:01:04.000 --> 00:01:21.000
The action stays the same. The governing policy changes the verdict.

00:01:21.000 --> 00:01:30.000
Explore the papers, code, datasets, and released guard models.

